{"scope":"rt-29e5b69b74","css":".rt-29e5b69b74 p.MsoNormal, .rt-29e5b69b74 li.MsoNormal, .rt-29e5b69b74 div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;}\n.rt-29e5b69b74 div.WordSection1 {}\n.rt-29e5b69b74 ol {margin-bottom:0cm;}\n.rt-29e5b69b74 ul {margin-bottom:0cm;}","html":"<div class=WordSection1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251657728;left:-80px;\r\ntop:18px;width:1041px;height:20px'><img width=833 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhEQQCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAEAAAAQBAIAgAAAAAAAAAJGBHKJq83vIpyy0msz3rrz74XgKJbkaaboqrbs68bwLNf0bef4rvf87wsCh8JQkYg8KpPMpbMJfUqj1Km1ir1qs9ytt0stAAA7\"><\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT\u00a0\r\nOF PATHOLOGY<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=MsoNormalTable border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width=767\r\n style='width:575.25pt;border-collapse:collapse'>\r\n <tr style='height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <td width=329 valign=top style='width:246.4pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>TEST NAME<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=117 valign=top style='width:87.95pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Viral\r\n  Load<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=118 valign=top style='width:88.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Units\r\n  <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=204 valign=top style='width:152.65pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Log\u00ad10Value<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>HEPATITIS B\r\nVIRUS (HBV) QUANTITIVE PCR <\/span><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0TND\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nIU\/Ml\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Interpretation<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width=753\r\n style='width:564.75pt;margin-left:8.55pt;border-collapse:collapse;border:none'>\r\n <tr style='height:14.25pt'>\r\n  <td width=210 valign=top style='width:157.5pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:14.25pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:-3.15pt;text-autospace:none'><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Target Not Detected\r\n  (TND)<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=543 valign=top style='width:407.25pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-left:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:14.25pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:-3.15pt;text-autospace:none'><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>HBV DNA was not\r\n  detected in the patient specimen<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:14.25pt'>\r\n  <td width=210 valign=top style='width:157.5pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:14.25pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&lt; 40 IU\/ml<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=543 valign=top style='width:407.25pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:14.25pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:-3.15pt;text-autospace:none'><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>HBV DNA detected\r\n  below the liner range of the assay<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:14.25pt'>\r\n  <td width=210 valign=top style='width:157.5pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:14.25pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>40 to 2.00 \u00d710\uf008IU\/mL<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=543 valign=top style='width:407.25pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:14.25pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:-3.15pt;text-autospace:none'><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>HBV DNA within the\r\n  linear range of the assay<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:14.25pt'>\r\n  <td width=210 valign=top style='width:157.5pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:14.25pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0&gt;2.00 \u00d710\uf008IU\/mL <\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=543 valign=top style='width:407.25pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:14.25pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:-3.15pt;text-autospace:none'><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>HBV DNA detected\r\n  above the linear range of the assay<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>The performance\r\nof this test has been validated at Department of molecular Biopsy laboratory<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Thyrocare\r\nTechnologies limited, Navi Mumbai<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Indications<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;line-height:150%;text-autospace:\r\nnone'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt'>The direct\r\ndetection of HBV DNA in plasma become an important tool in the diagnosis of HBV\r\ninfection. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt'>Furthermore, HBV\r\nDNA level may be an important prognostic indicator as well as an important\r\nmarker for measuring therapeutic response and the development of resistance to\r\nantiviral agents. Chronic HBV carriers are at increased risk for the\r\ndevelopment of cirrhosis and hepatocellular carcinoma.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Methodology<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>HBV detection by\r\npolymerase chain reaction (PCR) is based on the amplification of specific\r\nregions.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Of the HBV genome\r\n.In real Time PCR the amplified product is detected via fluorescent dyes.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Limitation of the\r\nassay<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>1. Presence of\r\nPCR inhibitors may interfere with PCR amplification.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>2. This test is\r\nnot intended for use in the initial diagnosis or confirmation of HBV infection.\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Disclaimer<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>1. This test is\r\nintended for use in conjunction with clinical presentation and other laboratory\r\nmarkers as an indicator of disease prognosis.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>2. Improper\r\nspecimen collection, handling, storage and transportation may results in false\r\nnegative results.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>3. The report\r\nrepresents only the specimen received in laboratory.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>References<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>1. Who guidelines\r\non Hepatitis B and Hepatitis C testing. Geneva : World Health organization;\r\n2017<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt'>2. artus HBV QS RGQ\r\nPerformance Characteristics version 1 , R3.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"612.0pt 792.0pt","margin":"148.85pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 1.0cm"}}